sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User (docker CLI or ctr)
  participant P as vesper-proxy (socket)
  participant L as vesper-vmlauncher (bridge socket)
  participant D as dockerd (in System VM)
  participant C as containerd (in System VM)
  participant R as runc (in System VM)
  participant S as containerd-shim-vesper-v2
  participant M as vesper-microvm (jailer + Firecracker)
  participant G as MicroVM guest (vesper-guest-session + runc)

  Note over U,R: docker run: a runc container in the System VM
  U->>P: docker run ... (run/vesper/docker.sock)
  P->>L: CONNECT 2375
  L->>D: guest vsock 2375 to /var/run/docker.sock
  D->>C: create and start task (default runtime)
  C->>R: start container
  U<<->>P: attach logs/stdin/stdout

  Note over U,G: ctr run --runtime io.containerd.vesper.v2: a microVM per task
  U->>C: ctr run (through vesper-agent on vsock 1024)
  C->>S: Create / Start (shim v2 over ttrpc)
  S->>S: validate bundle, build or reuse ext4 root drive, copy it for the task
  S->>M: vesper-microvm launch ID --rootfs IMAGE --guest-exec
  M->>G: boot jailed Firecracker microVM
  S->>G: RUN config on vsock 1025, stdio on ports from 1028
  G->>G: runc runs the init process
  G-->>S: STARTED pid, later EXIT status
  S-->>C: task state and exit status
